It is built with the OpenIDEA plugin SDK (https://github.com/l0ng-ai/openidea,
Apache License 2.0). The documentation guides, runtime API stubs, event catalog
and manifest directives in data/ are written by SensityTech.

Bundled data:
- data/natives/natives.json.gz, natives_cfx.json.gz, natives_rdr3.lua.gz:
  snapshots of the Cfx.re native database (https://docs.fivem.net/natives/,
  https://static.cfx.re/natives/), from citizenfx/natives.
- data/natives/rdr3_nativedb.json.gz: snapshot of alloc8or/rdr3-nativedb-data
  (https://github.com/alloc8or/rdr3-nativedb-data), descriptions of RDR3 natives.
- data/values/: factual value tables (controls, blips, markers, HUD colours,
  explosions, animation flags) extracted from the Cfx.re documentation and the
  databases above, and hash names from calamity-inc/gta-v-joaat-hash-db
  (https://github.com/calamity-inc/gta-v-joaat-hash-db, The Unlicense). See
  data/values/README.md for the source of each table.

